Package: WithinHostExperiment
Title: Within-Host Pathogen Variant QC, Diversity, and Bottleneck
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Cuiwei", family = "Gao",
    email = "48gaocuiwei@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a SummarizedExperiment-based container and
    workflow functions for analysing intra-host single nucleotide
    variants (iSNV) from pathogen deep sequencing data. Supports
    replicate-aware quality control with full provenance tracking,
    multi-caller import harmonisation, within-host diversity
    quantification, and standardised export to transmission bottleneck
    estimation tools. Designed as infrastructure that bridges upstream
    variant callers (iVar, LoFreq, Freebayes) with downstream analysis
    packages through a common data object with uncertainty-preserving QC.
